{
  "info": {
    "name": "N'DJIGI Authentication Test Suite",
    "description": "Collection complète pour tester le système d'authentification Keycloak - Identifie les anomalies critiques",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔴 ANOMALIES CRITIQUES",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "TEST #1: Admin reçoit rôle passager ❌",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"noe@gmail.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Heroskingjesus100#\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:8000/api/v1/auth/login",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "8000",
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "ANOMALIE #1 & #2: Admin dans Keycloak (ndjigi-admin) mais reçoit rôle passager en réponse\n\nVERIFICATION:\n✅ Keycloak roles: ['ndjigi-admin'] (CORRECT)\n❌ Frontend roles: ['passager'] (INCORRECT - devrait être ['ndjigi-admin'])\n❌ Raison: Auto-provisioning crée passager pour TOUS\n\nESPECTE:\n- Status: 200\n- data.requires_2fa: true (admin = 2FA requis)\n- data.user.roles[0]: 'passager' ❌ (DEVRAIT ÊTRE 'ndjigi-admin')"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "TEST #2: Gestionnaire reçoit rôle passager ❌",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"gestionnaire@test.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Heroskingjesus100#\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:8000/api/v1/auth/login",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "8000",
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "ANOMALIE #1: Gestionnaire reçoit rôle passager\n\nNOTE: Créer d'abord ce compte dans Keycloak avec rôle 'gestionnaire'\n\nESPECTE:\n- Status: 200\n- data.user.roles[0]: 'passager' ❌ (DEVRAIT ÊTRE 'gestionnaire')"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "TEST #3: Passager peut se connecter (mobile only) ❌",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"guetawende@gmail.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Heroskingjesus100#\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:8000/api/v1/auth/login",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "8000",
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "ANOMALIE #4: Passager n'a pas d'interface web (mobile seulement)\n\nPROBLEME: Passager se connecte avec succès mais pas d'interface pour lui\n\nESPECTE ACTUEL (incorrect):\n- Status: 200 ✅\n- data.requires_2fa: false\n- data.user.roles: ['passager']\n\nESPECTE CORRECT (non implémenté):\n- Status: 403 ❌ (Forbidden)\n- Message: \"Web access not available for this role. Use mobile app.\"\n- data: null"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "✅ TESTS DE BASE (FONCTIONNANT CORRECTEMENT)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login Admin avec 2FA",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin.test@ndjigi.local\",\n  \"password\": \"Admin@2026!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:8000/api/v1/auth/login",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "8000",
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Login avec 2FA requis\n\nESPECTE:\n- Status: 200\n- data.requires_2fa: true ✅\n- data.login_token: <uuid>\n- data.phone_masked: temp-690fc7**"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Verify SMS Code (2FA)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"login_token\": \"REPLACE_WITH_LOGIN_TOKEN\",\n  \"sms_code\": \"611699\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:8000/api/v1/auth/verify-sms",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "8000",
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "verify-sms"]
            },
            "description": "Vérifier le code SMS 2FA\n\nREMARQUE: En mode DEV, le code est toujours 611699 (voir logs)\n\nESPECTE:\n- Status: 200\n- data.access_token: <jwt>\n- data.refresh_token: <jwt>\n- data.user.roles: ['passager'] ❌ (ANOMALIE #2)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Resend SMS Code",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"login_token\": \"REPLACE_WITH_LOGIN_TOKEN\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:8000/api/v1/auth/resend-sms",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "8000",
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "resend-sms"]
            },
            "description": "Renvoyer le code SMS\n\nESPECTE:\n- Status: 200\n- message: 'Nouveau code SMS envoyé.'"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refresh_token\": \"REPLACE_WITH_REFRESH_TOKEN\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:8000/api/v1/auth/logout",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "8000",
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "logout"]
            },
            "description": "Logout utilisateur\n\nESPECTE:\n- Status: 200\n- success: true\n- message: 'Déconnexion réussie.'"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:8000/health",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "8000",
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "Vérifier que le backend est opérationnel\n\nESPECTE:\n- Status: 200\n- status: 'ok'"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "🔍 TESTS DE SYNCHRONISATION (NON IMPLÉMENTÉS)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "[EXPECTED] Vérifier rôles Keycloak synchronisés",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:8000/api/v1/auth/me",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "8000",
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "me"]
            },
            "description": "ENDPOINT NON IMPLÉMENTÉ\n\nCet endpoint devrait exister pour retourner:\n- Utilisateur actuel\n- Rôles Keycloak (source de vérité)\n- Rôles locaux\n- Permissions\n\nRéPONSE ATTENDUE:\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"id\": \"uuid\",\n    \"email\": \"user@test.com\",\n    \"keycloak_roles\": [\"ndjigi-admin\"],\n    \"local_roles\": [\"ndjigi-admin\"],\n    \"permissions\": [...]\n  }\n}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "[EXPECTED] Créer un utilisateur (IT seulement)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"newuser@test.com\",\n  \"firstname\": \"New\",\n  \"lastname\": \"User\",\n  \"role\": \"passager\",\n  \"phone\": \"+226XXXXXXXX\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:8000/api/v1/users",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "8000",
              "path": ["api", "v1", "users"]
            },
            "description": "ENDPOINT NON IMPLÉMENTÉ\n\nCet endpoint devrait:\n1. Vérifier que l'utilisateur courant a le rôle 'IT'\n2. Créer l'utilisateur dans Keycloak\n3. Assigner le rôle demandé\n4. Créer l'enregistrement en BDD locale\n5. Envoyer email d'invitation\n\nRÉPONSE ATTENDUE:\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"id\": \"uuid\",\n    \"email\": \"newuser@test.com\",\n    \"role\": \"passager\"\n  }\n}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "🔐 TESTS DE SÉCURITÉ",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Test: Passager ne peut pas accéder /admin",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer REPLACE_WITH_PASSAGER_TOKEN"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/users",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "8000",
              "path": ["api", "v1", "admin", "users"]
            },
            "description": "Vérifier que passager ne peut pas accéder aux endpoints admin\n\nESPECTE ATTENDU:\n- Status: 403 (Forbidden)\n- Message: 'Access denied. Admin role required.'\n\nESPECTE ACTUEL:\n- Probablement 200 (accès non contrôlé)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Test: Token expiré",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsInR5cCIgOiAiSldUIiwia2lkIiA6ICJpUTZYV3FrdS1JMCJ9.eyJleHAiOjE2MjkxMDAwMDB9.invalid"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:8000/api/v1/auth/me",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "8000",
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Test avec token expiré ou invalide\n\nESPECTE:\n- Status: 401 (Unauthorized)"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "📊 ANALYSE DE DONNÉES",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Log utilisateurs actuels en BDD",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:8000/health",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "8000",
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "ENDPOINT NON IMPLÉMENTÉ\n\nDevrait lister tous les utilisateurs avec:\n- Email\n- Keycloak ID\n- Rôle Keycloak (from JWT)\n- Rôle Local (from DB)\n- Synchronisé? (rôle_keycloak === rôle_local)\n\nRÉSULTAT ATTENDU:\n[\n  {\n    \"email\": \"noe@gmail.com\",\n    \"keycloak_role\": \"ndjigi-admin\",\n    \"local_role\": \"passager\",\n    \"synchronized\": false ❌\n  },\n  {\n    \"email\": \"guetawende@gmail.com\",\n    \"keycloak_role\": null,\n    \"local_role\": \"passager\",\n    \"synchronized\": true ✅\n  }\n]"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
